<title>USA: USDA ups Pakistan GSM-102 credits by $25 mln.</title>
<headline>USDA ups Pakistan GSM-102 credits by $25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said it raised by $25 million the amount of GSM-102 credit guarantees available for sales of U.S. farmgoods to Pakistan under the Export Credit Guarantee Program.</p>
<p>The action increases Pakistan's fiscal year 1997 allocation to $325 million.</p>
</text>
